msgstr "Sempre presente — ogni nuovo ordine che non è un pre-ordine inizia qui."

#: templates/admin/settings-tabbed.php:1085
msgid "These two columns cannot be removed, renamed to a different key, or reordered — they carry the automatic pre-order routing. You can still rename their label."
